<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Surat Peminjaman</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 20px; }
    h2 { text-align: center; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
    td, th { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Surat Peminjaman Barang</h2>

  <p>Yang bertanda tangan di bawah ini:</p>
  <p><b>Nama Peminjam:</b> <%= surat.borrowerName %></p>
  <p><b>Lokasi:</b> <%= surat.location %></p>

  <p>Menyatakan telah meminjam barang berikut:</p>

  <table>
    <tr><th>Nama Device</th><td><%= surat.deviceName %></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Jenis</th><td><%= surat.type %></td></tr>
    <tr><th>Tanggal Pinjam</th><td><%= surat.borrowedAt %></td></tr>
  </table>

  <form action="/peminjaman/simpan" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="deviceId" value="<%= surat.deviceId %>">
    <input type="hidden" name="borrowerName" value="<%= surat.borrowerName %>">
    <input type="hidden" name="location" value="<%= surat.location %>">
    <button type="submit" style="margin-top:20px; padding:10px 20px; background:green; color:white;">Simpan Peminjaman</button>
  </form>
</body>
</html>
